file: macros/src/agreement.rs
breaks: Every other variant's associated const is checked at compile time to agree with the first's, as `docs/what-is-generated.md` says.
expect: survives
reason: No trait of a cell declares an associated const, so no cell has consts to agree or disagree.

find:
                    #(#cfgs)* assert!(#equal, #message);
replace:
                    #(#cfgs)* let _ = (#equal, #message);
